{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25401","headline":"雨後净望河西连山怆然成咏 · 李德裕","name":"雨後净望河西连山怆然成咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宿雨初收晚吹繁，秋光极目自销魂。\n烟山北下归辽海，鸿鴈南飞出蓟门。\n只恨无功书史籍，岂悲临老事戎轩。\n唯怀药饵蠲衰病，爲惜余年报主恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25401.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25401","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}